g THEM in the grass, THEN retry. Next: Build a team strong enough to beat a trainer at Route 24, then push on toward Cerulean City. Bigger picture: Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Your team right now: wartortle (L24), ekans (L11), spearow (L11), rattata (L10). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "1 badge(s) earned (Boulder). Next gym: Misty of Cerulean City. Pokédex: 5 caught. She's one badge in — the adventure's really starting (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'wartortle (L24), ekans (L11), spearow (L11), rattata (L10)', 'goal': {'short': 'Level the weak ones (ekans, spearow and rattata) to ~L16 by fielding THEM in the grass, THEN retry', 'medium': 'Build a team strong enough to beat a trainer at Route 24, then push on toward Cerulean City', 'long': 'Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge'}} options=['head_to_gym', 'battle', 'wander_catch', 'talk_npc', 'travel:3,21', 'travel:3,43', 'travel:3,27', 'travel:3,20', 'travel:3,26', 'fetch_keeper']

